# ---- Reference system: IntelliLung's repository (third-party, 17 MB) ----
# arXiv:2506.14375's code, cloned locally so `benchmark/tests/test_reward_critique.py`
# can check our claims against their actual source. It is SOMEBODY ELSE'S repository
# with its own .git/ and licence — committing it here would redistribute their code
# under ours. The benchmark tests skip cleanly when it is absent, so a clean checkout
# still passes. Clone it yourself if you want to re-run those checks.
intellilung-advancing-mechanical-ventilation/

