# ---- Generated benchmark artifact ----
# comparison_table.md is RE-RENDERED from comparison_table.json on every build, so
# tracking it means a diff on every run for no information gain. The JSON beside it
# IS tracked, and `python -m benchmark.comparison_table` regenerates the markdown.
benchmark/results/comparison_table.md
